  "title": "Ham Cake-ettes",
  "description": "These ham cakes feature mashed potatoes, green onion, and Dijon mustard rolled in panko bread crumbs and fried until golden brown for tasty cake-ettes.",
  "authors": [
    "Avon- status quo PRO"
  ],
